---
/**
 * CMS visual-editing overlay. A NO-OP until a CMS is wired in.
 *
 * BaseLayout mounts this unconditionally so that adding a CMS never has to
 * patch the layout (which is customised per build). `scripts/add-sanity.sh`
 * replaces this file with the Sanity <VisualEditing /> version.
 *
 * The PUBLIC_SANITY_VISUAL_EDITING_ENABLED flag BaseLayout reads stays false
 * without a CMS, so the draft-preview behaviours it gates (no-store, noindex,
 * analytics suppressed) are all inert here.
 */
